OL,3,GNEWSATown marks 100th anniversary of
OL,4,AWinnie-the-Pooh
OL,5,
OL,6,FA town is marking Winnie-the-Pooh's
OL,7,Fcentenary with a programme of family
OL,8,Factivities celebrating the classic
OL,9,Fchildren's book.
OL,11,FThe event in Beverley has been
OL,12,Forganised by the town council in
OL,13,Fpartnership with a range of local
OL,14,Forganisations, businesses and schools.
OL,16,FOfficials said the celebrations would
OL,17,Fbring the magic of the Hundred Acre
OL,18,FWood to the town through a variety of
OL,19,Factivities for all ages.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
